{"id":28619,"slug":"la-dolce-vita","title":"La dolce vita","year":1960,"country":"Italy","duration":174,"spine":733,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28619-la-dolce-vita","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/41271853307b3fb10334a7d2b51e41ce/pDxTYardFcKk8EIL1qgmAJ96A9zCTn_large.jpg","description":"The biggest hit from the most popular Italian filmmaker of all time, La dolce vita rocketed Federico Fellini to international mainstream success—ironically, by offering a damning critique of the culture of stardom. A look at the darkness beneath the seductive lifestyles of Rome’s rich and glamorous, the film follows a notorious celebrity journalist (a sublimely cool Marcello Mastroianni) during a hectic week spent on the peripheries of the spotlight. This mordant picture was an incisive commentary on the deepening decadence of contemporary Europe, and it provided a prescient glimpse of just how gossip- and fame-obsessed our society would become.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Federico Fellini","slug":"federico-fellini"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Marcello Mastroianni","role":"Marcello Rubini","slug":"marcello-mastroianni"},{"actor":"Anita Ekberg","role":"Sylvia","slug":"anita-ekberg"},{"actor":"Anouk Aimée","role":"Maddalena","slug":"anouk-aimee"},{"actor":"Yvonne Furneaux","role":"Emma","slug":"yvonne-furneaux"},{"actor":"Magali Noël","role":"Fanny","slug":"magali-noel"},{"actor":"Alain Cuny","role":"Steiner","slug":"alain-cuny"},{"actor":"Annibale Ninchi","role":"Marcello’s father","slug":"annibale-ninchi"},{"actor":"Walter Santesso","role":"Paparazzo","slug":"walter-santesso"},{"actor":"Lex Barker","role":"Robert","slug":"lex-barker"},{"actor":"Nadia Gray","role":"Nadia","slug":"nadia-gray"},{"actor":"Valeria Ciangottini","role":"Paola","slug":"valeria-ciangottini"},{"actor":"Riccardo Garrone","role":"Riccardo","slug":"riccardo-garrone"},{"actor":"Audrey McDonald","role":"Jane","slug":"audrey-mcdonald"},{"actor":"Polidor","role":"Pagli